[[File:KiSteer_1284_projectile_rifle.jpg|thumb|250px|[[Zam Wesell]] aiming with her [[KiSteer 1284 projectile rifle]]]]
{{Quote|That was the butt of the ''rifle'' that's now pointed at your head. Stay down.|[[Boba Fett]] threatening [[Luke Skywalker]]|<ref name="Star Wars 2015 6">[[Star Wars (2015) 6|''Star Wars'' (2015) 6]]</ref>}}
A '''rifle''' was a type of large firearm designed to be fired from the shoulder. Types of rifles included [[blaster rifle]]s<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|blaster-rifle|Blaster Rifle}}</ref> which fired bolts of intense light energy,<ref name="SWEbla">{{SWE|technology|lightsaber|Lightsaber}}</ref> and [[slugthrower]] rifles which fired solid [[Slug|projectiles]].<ref name="SWE">{{SWE|groups|tuskenraiders|Tusken Raiders}}</ref> A [[concussion rifle]] discharged a concussion blast.<ref name="BF">''[[Star Wars Battlefront]]''</ref> The [[Cycler rifle|Tusken Cycler]] used by the [[Tusken Raider|Sand People]] of [[Tatooine]] was a [[slugthrower rifle]].<ref name="Ultimate">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref>

